{
    "background_story": "Sir Emely, a gallant knight of the realm, was renowned for her unwavering dedication to justice and honor. Her trusty armor, adorned with the emblem of her noble family, included a finely crafted habergeon - a sleeveless coat of mail that protected her torso from the fiercest of battles. With her habergeon securely fastened, Emely rode into the fray, her sword flashing in the sunlight as she charged against the forces of darkness. Her unshakeable courage and unrelenting pursuit of righteousness earned her the respect and admiration of her peers. As a defender of the innocent and a champion of the realm, Emely's name became synonymous with bravery and chivalry. Her habergeon, a symbol of her unyielding commitment to her code of honor, remained by her side throughout her illustrious career.",
